sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant UI as Exercise UI
  participant S as Learning Service
  participant D as Domain Rules
  participant DB as IndexedDB/Dexie

  U->>UI: Submit answer
  UI->>S: answer + time + hints + confidence
  S->>D: score / suggested rating
  D-->>S: Attempt result + next review + mastery deltas
  S->>DB: Transaction: attempt, review, mastery, session, plan
  DB-->>S: Commit success
  S-->>UI: Feedback + next due
  UI-->>U: Explanation and rating controls
